                    "frequency": "VeryLow",
                    "semantic_group_id": "",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "Under the old procedural rules, the defendant was commanded by a <w>subpoena</w> to answer the bill in equity."
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "The Chancery court issued a formal <w>subpoena</w> requiring the respondent to appear in London."
